### Structure Rules

1. `/app` contains ONLY route definitions — thin files that import from `/pages`
2. `/pages` contains actual page components (< 400 lines each)
3. Every page component has a co-located `.styles.ts` file
4. Router ignores `.styles.ts` files via `unstable_settings.ignore`
5. `/hooks` is the single source of truth for all business logic
6. `/queries` and `/mutations` are the single source of truth for all GraphQL operations
7. `/types` is the single source of truth for all type definitions
8. `/components/DS/` is the design system — reusable across the entire app
9. `/lib` contains one-time initialization code for external services
10. `/utils` contains pure functions with no React dependencies

