## Performance Best Practices

### Memoization

- `useMemo` for all computed/derived/filtered data
- `useCallback` for ALL handler functions
- Proper dependency arrays — no missing or extra deps

### FlatList Optimization

```tsx
<FlatList
  data={items}
  renderItem={renderItem}
  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}
  removeClippedSubviews={true}
  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}
  windowSize={10}
  initialNumToRender={5}
/>
```

### Avoid Inline Functions in JSX

```tsx
// WRONG
<Button onPress={() => handleAction(item.id)} />

// CORRECT
const onPress = useCallback(() => handleAction(item.id), [item.id, handleAction])
<Button onPress={onPress} />
```

