## Error Handling

### In Hooks

```typescript
const handleAction = useCallback(async () => {
  try {
    const result = await executeQuery({ ... })
    if (result) { /* success */ }
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('Context about what failed:', err)
    // Sentry captures automatically via logger
  }
}, [executeQuery])
```

### In GraphQL Hook

- Auth token injection
- Query deduplication (10s cache)
- Sentry tracing per query
- Structured error logging via logger utility

