## Checklist — Every New Page

- [ ] Route file in `/app` (thin proxy)
- [ ] Page component in `/pages` (< 400 lines, UI only)
- [ ] Style file co-located as `.styles.ts`
- [ ] Custom hook in `/hooks/usePageName.ts` (all logic)
- [ ] Hook returns flat object
- [ ] GraphQL queries in `/queries`
- [ ] GraphQL mutations in `/mutations`
- [ ] Types in `/types`
- [ ] All handlers wrapped in `useCallback`
- [ ] All computed values in `useMemo`
- [ ] Theme-aware styles via `createStyles(theme)`
- [ ] Imports organized per import order rules

## Checklist — Every New Component

- [ ] Lives in `/components/DS/` (design system) or `/components/[Feature]/`
- [ ] Co-located `.styles.ts`
- [ ] Props typed with interface
- [ ] Purely presentational — no business logic
- [ ] < 400 lines

## Checklist — Every New Hook

- [ ] Lives in `/hooks/`
- [ ] Uses `useGraphQL` directly (no wrapper hooks)
- [ ] Imports queries from `/queries`, mutations from `/mutations`
- [ ] Flat return object
- [ ] Handlers prefixed with `handle`, wrapped in `useCallback`
- [ ] Computed values in `useMemo`
- [ ] Internal order follows the prescribed sequence
